@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Shipping policy for buyers - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Shipping";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Shipping policy for buyers";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p>Our team works hard to make sure shipping is as fast and easy as possible.</p>

        <p>We partner with carriers operating all over the world to ensure your order is delivered safely and securely.</p>

        <p>After you complete your purchase, we'll create a prepaid label for the seller so they can ship your item hassle-free. The vast majority of Lively labels come with tracking to help provide you and the seller peace of mind while your order is in transit.</p>

        <p>You can get the latest shipping updates and estimated delivery date from the Order Details page.</p>

        <p>When you add a new payment method during checkout, double-check that your shipping address is up-to-date.</p>

        <p>Lively offers free local pickup for certain sellers. For more information on local pickup please visit <a asp-action="UseFreePickup">Free Pickup</a> on Lively.</p>

        <h2>Shipping time frame</h2>
        <p>We ask sellers to ship orders within 2 business days of the item being sold.</p>

        <p>On average, an order purchased through Lively arrives to you in 7 days. However, it is typical for an order to take up to 14 days. If your tracking stops receiving updates, we recommend contacting the shipping provider. If they can't locate the package and there hasn't been a tracking update for 14 or more days, please submit a <a href="#">request through the app</a> to get help with your order.</p>

        <h2>Where does Lively ship to?</h2>
        <p>



        </p>


        <p>Whatnot ships to most countries around the world. Please write to our support team to request shipping to your country (if not available) and we will work on it!</p>

        <h2>International Shipping</h2>
        <h3>Cost varies by location.</h3>

        <p>Here are a few things you should know about our international shipping:</p>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>The buyer is responsible for all local customs fees and taxes.</strong></li>
            <li>
                Shipping time depends on the country, but typically takes 1-4 weeks.
            </li>
            <li> Please note, some carriers do not have a guaranteed delivery time for international packages using this service, and depending on your country's postal and custom services it can take a longer period of time.</li>
                
        </ul>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>